1
00:00:05,375 --> 00:00:08,166
Ba a haifi ɗaya ba:
amma ya zama mace.

2
00:00:08,191 --> 00:00:11,391
Babu makoma ta ilimin
halitta, tunani ko tattalin arziki

3
00:00:11,392 --> 00:00:14,932
Tana bayyana siffar
mata a cikin al'umma:

4
00:00:14,933 --> 00:00:17,466
Duk wayewa ce ta halicce ta.

5
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:19,735
Wannan ko da yake
har yanzu yana nan.

6
00:00:19,802 --> 00:00:22,268
Duk da cewa daga 1949.
